 "notes": "Level_02 — More difficult movement\n\nChapter 1 · More difficult movement. Target difficulty 1.5/10.\n\nSame two controls, a longer walk, and two trees placed so the pair cannot simply drift to the coops. Somewhere in the route a press lands on a tree: the chick does not move and both arrows flip. That is the second movement rule, met here with nothing else going on.\n\nStill nothing that can be broken or lost, so a player can experiment freely.\n\nShortest solution: 11 steps (RLLRRLLLRRR).",
